      ],
      "extract": "One of the most important coideal subalgebras contained in t he quantized enveloping algebra is the locally ﬁnite part, F (U), deﬁned by (2.1). This subalgebra is studied extensively in [JL1] and [JL2] (see al so [Jo]). Here we present some of the known results about this algebra by direc tly showing thatF (U) is a coideal subalgebra of U. We will see some of the implications of Section 4 on the structure of F (U).",
