        }
      ],
      "extract": "We turn now to the theory of quantum symmetric pairs. First, w e present the construction and characterization of the coideal subal gebras used to form such pairs. The results are drawn from [L2] and [L3], but the m ethods in this paper are often simpler. The involutions used to cons truct these algebras are given in a concrete fashion here. The relations for the coideal subalgebras as algebras are also presented",
